---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/interview-loop-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/interview-loop-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={680}
  caption="The overnight loop between interview days: the slow, accurate model runs while nobody is waiting on it."
>
  A day of interviews is captured locally with names scrubbed. Overnight, a
  slower and more accurate model re-transcribes the audio, and the synthesis
  fan runs: per-person notes, a hypothesis scorecard update, a contradictions
  file. The interview guides are re-aimed at the thinnest evidence, and the
  loop returns to the next morning's interviews.
</Diagram>
